aling or 15% of the shielding after a 0.5-second delay. Bonus shielding lasts as long as the shield that triggered the effect, up to a maximum duration of 4 seconds."]}]},{"slot":"Q","variants":[{"name":"Formless Blade","rows":[{"attribute":"Minimum Physical Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[5,10,15,20,25],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[90,95,100,105,110],"units":["% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD"]}]},{"attribute":"Maximum Physical Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[10,20,30,40,50],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[180,190,200,210,220],"units":["% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD","% AD"]}]}],"damageType":"PHYSICAL_DAMAGE","effects":["Passive: Nilah gains 0% : 33% (based on critical strike chance) armor penetration. Her basic attacks and Formless Blade heal her for 0% : 20% (based on critical strike chance) of the post-mitigation damage dealt to champions, converting each heal instance beyond maximum health into a shield that lasts 6 seconds.","If Formless Blade is cast during Slipstream, Nilah leaves behind a wave that is sent towards her location at the end of the dash, dealing the same damage to enemies hit.","If Formless Blade hits an enemy, Nilah empowers herself for 4 seconds: gaining 125 bonus attack range and 10% : 60% (based on level) bonus attack speed, and causing her basic attacks to strike in a cone that deals 100% AD physical damage to enemies hit. Against secondary non-champion targets, this is reduced to 33% AD for minions and 10% AD for monsters, and additionally executes minions left below 20 health. On-hit effects are applied only to the primary target."]}]},{"slot":"W","variants":[{"name":"Jubilant Veil","rows":[{"attribute":"Bonus Movement Speed","modifiers":[{"values":[15,17.5,20,22.5,25],"units":["%","%","%","%","%"]}]}],"damageType":null,"effects":["Allied champions she touches will also be enveloped for 1.5 seconds, gaining the same effects."]}]},{"slot":"E","variants":[{"name":"Slipstream","rows":[{"attribute":"Physical Damage","modifiers":[{"v